    "explanations": [
      "'Иметь значение' (to have significance/to matter) is a fixed collocation. Russian collocations are unpredictable: 'играть роль' (play a role), 'оказывать влияние' (exert influence), 'принимать решение' (make a decision); the verb cannot be freely substituted."
